sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SRC as Benefits records
    participant FEED as Perquisite feed
    participant WB as Section 08 wage-base resolver
    participant ENG as Section 08 TDS and payslip
    participant APP as Approver
    Note over SRC: OPEN - declarations, proofs, issues, gifts, coverage and acks recorded
    ENG->>SRC: INPUTS_CLOSED fixes the as-of decision time
    SRC->>WB: A changed declaration split signals a recompute, BEN-97
    WB-->>ENG: PF, gratuity and wages bases for the period
    SRC->>FEED: Ledgers, day statuses, confirmed coverage, approved proofs
    FEED->>FEED: Evaluate meal, gift, FBP heads, premiums, retiral ledger
    FEED->>ENG: Perquisite inputs, new or superseding, idempotent ids
    ENG->>ENG: PROCESSED - projection and payslip lines
    ENG->>APP: Pre-run benefits exceptions report
    alt An open blocking task, BV-14
        APP-->>ENG: Approval held until the task is done
    else No blocking task
        APP->>ENG: APPROVED then LOCKED
    end
    Note over FEED,ENG: After LOCKED a correction for the period is a superseding input for the next open run
